        Overrule([Overrule Proposed Allocation])
        Departure([Record Grain Departure])
        Monitor([Monitor Silo Conditions])
        Report([Produce Elevator Report])
        Log([Produce Transaction Log])
    end
    Manager --- Arrival
    Manager --- Overrule
    Manager --- Departure
    Manager --- Report
    Manager --- Log
    Sensors --- Monitor
    Arrival -.->|«include»| Allocate
